# ZeroStick Calibration Dongle — the app's dongle screens

This folder is the **ZeroStick Calibration Dongle** app: the screens for the
dongle that ships with the DualSense Edge stick modules (connect over
Bluetooth, calibrate the sticks, stick flex setup, Recoil & Aim "Script
Edition", firmware updates) and the stick calibrator it opens, which also still
talks to the **original WiFi calibrator** (ESP32-S2, "ZeroStick-Calibrator").

